### SOURCE MODE EXAMPLE
### Requires DATABASE_URL:
### DATABASE_URL=postgres://postgres:postgres@localhost:5434/source_example npm run start:dev

### Get info
GET http://localhost:3000

### Get status
GET http://localhost:3000/status

###
### ORDER FLOW
###

### Place an order
POST http://localhost:3000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "cust-123",
  "items": [{"productId": "laptop", "quantity": 1}],
  "total": 999.99
}

### Get order (state rebuilt from events)
GET http://localhost:3000/orders/order-XXXXX

### Get order event history
GET http://localhost:3000/orders/order-XXXXX/events

### Cancel order
POST http://localhost:3000/orders/order-XXXXX/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Customer requested cancellation"
}

### Get order again (now shows cancelled status - rebuilt from 2 events)
GET http://localhost:3000/orders/order-XXXXX

### Get event history (now shows 2 events: OrderPlacedEvent, OrderCancelledEvent)
GET http://localhost:3000/orders/order-XXXXX/events
